(7683986, 1257818, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the building is almost camaflouged by all the trees, branches and brush. I like it in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Interesting how the building is almost camaflouged by all the trees, branches and brush. I like it in B&W.', '2021-01-10 07:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683987, 1257510, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting how this building looks like it could be in the deep forest with all the ivy enveloping it and yet there are other buildings that are not neglected in the background. Looks like it is still in use. I wonder what is inside?</td>', 'Interesting how this building looks like it could be in the deep forest with all the ivy enveloping it and yet there are other buildings that are not neglected in the background. Looks like it is still in use. I wonder what is inside?', '2021-01-10 07:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683988, 1257571, 3306, '<td valign="top">Guess there isnt much of a market for mini cabs especially during COVID! Is that a mini building with a mini door and a mini window?</td>', 'Guess there isnt much of a market for mini cabs especially during COVID! Is that a mini building with a mini door and a mini window?', '2021-01-10 07:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683989, 1257787, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like images like this. The patterns and rustic nature are always interesting.</td>', 'I like images like this. The patterns and rustic nature are always interesting.', '2021-01-10 07:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683990, 1257809, 3306, '<td valign="top">I wonder why one widow is left uncovered? Id love to go inside and walk around.  I would like to see how this picture looks in B&amp;W. It would make the shadows look more interesting.</td>', 'I wonder why one widow is left uncovered? Id love to go inside and walk around.  I would like to see how this picture looks in B&W. It would make the shadows look more interesting.', '2021-01-10 07:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683991, 1257817, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of your picture but like your title its more about the path then the abandoned buildings. I would like to go walking around there to see what there is but with the mountains in the background I would want to move on and see what nature has to offer. The buildings are only a small part of the interest in the picture not the subject.</td>', 'I like the idea of your picture but like your title its more about the path then the abandoned buildings. I would like to go walking around there to see what there is but with the mountains in the background I would want to move on and see what nature has to offer. The buildings are only a small part of the interest in the picture not the subject.', '2021-01-10 07:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683993, 1257775, 3306, '<td valign="top">What an interesting place! I am imagining that this is an alleyway and she is a worker taking a break from work in some kind of warehouse. It would be cool if she had a cigarette in her mouth with smoke tracing away from her face.</td>', 'What an interesting place! I am imagining that this is an alleyway and she is a worker taking a break from work in some kind of warehouse. It would be cool if she had a cigarette in her mouth with smoke tracing away from her face.', '2021-01-10 07:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683995, 1257710, 3306, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like the broken glass is in the image of a leaf which makes the branch more interesting. Good eye.</td>', 'It almost looks like the broken glass is in the image of a leaf which makes the branch more interesting. Good eye.', '2021-01-10 07:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683996, 1257731, 3306, '<td valign="top">The house doesnt look like it is in terrible shape. Maybe it could be fixed up? The area around it looks somewhat maintained. Makes me wonder what the story is.</td>', 'The house doesnt look like it is in terrible shape. Maybe it could be fixed up? The area around it looks somewhat maintained. Makes me wonder what the story is.', '2021-01-10 07:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683997, 1257725, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I like the fallen leaves and the overall composition and idea that this is a small cabin in the woods. The only thing that detracts from my minds eye is the building in the background. You might have been able to mask it under standard editing rules.</td>', 'Nice capture. I like the fallen leaves and the overall composition and idea that this is a small cabin in the woods. The only thing that detracts from my minds eye is the building in the background. You might have been able to mask it under standard editing rules.', '2021-01-10 07:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683998, 1257793, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. I like everything about this picture, the birdhouse is intriguing to me. Love it in B&amp;W and the soft focus.</td>', 'Very nice capture. I like everything about this picture, the birdhouse is intriguing to me. Love it in B&W and the soft focus.', '2021-01-10 07:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7683999, 1257805, 3306, '<td valign="top">Quite mysterious!</td>', 'Quite mysterious!', '2021-01-10 07:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684000, 1257747, 3306, '<td valign="top">Cool looking building. The birds are so interesting. I like the low angle and perspective of the picture. It makes the building look bigger than it probably is.</td>', 'Cool looking building. The birds are so interesting. I like the low angle and perspective of the picture. It makes the building look bigger than it probably is.', '2021-01-10 07:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684001, 1257771, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the clean lines and perspective of your composition.</td>', 'I like the clean lines and perspective of your composition.', '2021-01-10 07:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684002, 1257514, 3306, '<td valign="top">Amazing Graffiti. It should be in a museum! Love the colors.</td>', 'Amazing Graffiti. It should be in a museum! Love the colors.', '2021-01-10 07:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684003, 1257755, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the scene. It tells me a lot about the environment in which the building is placed. Makes me want to know more about the history of the little house and who lived there.</td>', 'I like the scene. It tells me a lot about the environment in which the building is placed. Makes me want to know more about the history of the little house and who lived there.', '2021-01-10 07:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684004, 1257743, 3306, '<td valign="top">Your composition is intriguing and interesting. So much I want to know about its structure and the drawings on the walls. I think the artificial sunburst through the roof is a little over dramatic and takes away from the natural beauty of the scene. Still not a bad shot!</td>', 'Your composition is intriguing and interesting. So much I want to know about its structure and the drawings on the walls. I think the artificial sunburst through the roof is a little over dramatic and takes away from the natural beauty of the scene. Still not a bad shot!', '2021-01-10 07:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684005, 1257608, 3306, '<td valign="top">I would have loved that treehouse as a child!!</td>', 'I would have loved that treehouse as a child!!', '2021-01-10 08:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684006, 1257808, 3306, '<td valign="top">No doubt in disrepair!</td>', 'No doubt in disrepair!', '2021-01-10 08:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684007, 1257799, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very interesting contrasts to your image, the black sky and yet sunlight on the building. I am interested to know if the post office came after the Austin White Lime company or before? If it was a post office why no sign except for the mailbox? Makes me want to know more about it.</td>', 'Very interesting contrasts to your image, the black sky and yet sunlight on the building. I am interested to know if the post office came after the Austin White Lime company or before? If it was a post office why no sign except for the mailbox? Makes me want to know more about it.', '2021-01-10 08:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684008, 1257801, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like this scene. The light snow really helps to draw attention to the red door and the structure.</td>', 'I really like this scene. The light snow really helps to draw attention to the red door and the structure.', '2021-01-10 08:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684009, 1257814, 3306, '<td valign="top">I love old barns. I dont get the impression that this one is abandoned just weathered and needs some repair. Maybe another perspective would have been more defining.</td>', 'I love old barns. I dont get the impression that this one is abandoned just weathered and needs some repair. Maybe another perspective would have been more defining.', '2021-01-10 08:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684010, 1257480, 3306, '<td valign="top">How unusual!</td>', 'How unusual!', '2021-01-10 08:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684011, 1257530, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great reflection. I would love to be there with you and play around with perspective! I think I would crop out the right side and concentrate on the building eliminating the distracting background.</td>', 'Great reflection. I would love to be there with you and play around with perspective! I think I would crop out the right side and concentrate on the building eliminating the distracting background.', '2021-01-10 08:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684012, 1257761, 3306, '<td valign="top">This really defines this challenge. I really like it. Deserves to ribbon.</td>', 'This really defines this challenge. I really like it. Deserves to ribbon.', '2021-01-10 08:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684013, 1257807, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting leading lines. Good composition.</td>', 'Interesting leading lines. Good composition.', '2021-01-10 08:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7684014, 1257649, 3306, '<td valign="top">Love the complexity of design.</td>', 'Love the complexity of design.', '2021-01-10 08:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
