(7684065, 1257608, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite. It''s not only a quaint and unique little house, but it also brings back memories of stories my small son used to tell me. They began ''Once there was an old, old house and nobody lived there anymore''. So this really gives me a hit of nostalgia. 10</td>', 'This is my favourite. It''s not only a quaint and unique little house, but it also brings back memories of stories my small son used to tell me. They began ''Once there was an old, old house and nobody lived there anymore''. So this really gives me a hit of nostalgia. 10', '2021-01-10 23:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
