(7684071, 1257747, 59029, '<td valign="top">Nice work, that little bit of light flare really sets it off well. Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Nice work, that little bit of light flare really sets it off well. Congrats on the ribbon!', '2021-01-11 00:23:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684072, 1257462, 124815, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot, great processing, amazing light.<br/>Did not have time to leave the comment before</td>', 'A wonderful shot, great processing, amazing light.Did not have time to leave the comment before', '2021-01-11 00:24:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684073, 1257761, 124815, '<td valign="top">Very cinematic. Very well done.</td>', 'Very cinematic. Very well done.', '2021-01-11 00:25:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684074, 1257743, 59029, '<td valign="top">My kinda place to shoot!  Well seen and love the light.  Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'My kinda place to shoot!  Well seen and love the light.  Congrats on the HM!', '2021-01-11 00:25:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684075, 1257799, 124815, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and the processing is wonderful also. It has a flair of a great classic picture. I gave 7 and then I forgot to go back and bump up</td>', 'I really like this shot and the processing is wonderful also. It has a flair of a great classic picture. I gave 7 and then I forgot to go back and bump up', '2021-01-11 00:27:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684076, 1257462, 67145, '<td valign="top">ahha .. so this one was yours .. <br/>and i''m looking at this now on my windows 10 laptop and the colours look fine .. it does tend to make yellows a bit duller than my other devices tho ..  <br/>i suppose we should all take into account different monitors and make allowances .. <br/>because this is perfect .. <br/>many congratulations on the ribbon and a wonderful find .. <br/>also i do feel in this challenge .. in a lot of cases .. it was like giving these abandoned buildings a voice .. :)</td>', 'ahha .. so this one was yours .. and i''m looking at this now on my windows 10 laptop and the colours look fine .. it does tend to make yellows a bit duller than my other devices tho ..  i suppose we should all take into account different monitors and make allowances .. because this is perfect .. many congratulations on the ribbon and a wonderful find .. also i do feel in this challenge .. in a lot of cases .. it was like giving these abandoned buildings a voice .. :)', '2021-01-11 00:39:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684077, 1257761, 67145, '<td valign="top">many congratulations on your blue ribbon and for an excellent take on the challenge .. <br/>its interesting that you felt the energy .. as a photo i dont see it like that .. but i wasnt there . <br/>ppl move on . and the things they leave behind are often just things .. <br/>there''s so much more than material possessions for us to value in this life .. <br/>but thats just my take atm .. <br/>dont get me wrong . this is a wonderful statement  ..  abandoned for sure .. :)</td>', 'many congratulations on your blue ribbon and for an excellent take on the challenge .. its interesting that you felt the energy .. as a photo i dont see it like that .. but i wasnt there . ppl move on . and the things they leave behind are often just things .. there''s so much more than material possessions for us to value in this life .. but thats just my take atm .. dont get me wrong . this is a wonderful statement  ..  abandoned for sure .. :)', '2021-01-11 00:46:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684078, 1257747, 67145, '<td valign="top">was one of my favs in the challenge .. along with the other ribbons for sure . <br/>this old building altho abandoned and empty has definitely not been forgotten .. and like i said in my comment during voting .. how wonderful that it became the canvas for ppl to draw on . and what uplifting artwork .. birds .. they represent to me life, joy and hope .. this is wonderful and congratulations on your ribbon . :)</td>', 'was one of my favs in the challenge .. along with the other ribbons for sure . this old building altho abandoned and empty has definitely not been forgotten .. and like i said in my comment during voting .. how wonderful that it became the canvas for ppl to draw on . and what uplifting artwork .. birds .. they represent to me life, joy and hope .. this is wonderful and congratulations on your ribbon . :)', '2021-01-11 00:49:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684079, 1257743, 67145, '<td valign="top">i''ll have to disagree with you and anyone else who wasnt a fan of the sunflare  .. or the intensity of it .. ;)<br/>i love it .. as well as the excellent edit you have given this .. so grungy .. and appropriate .. <br/>congratulations on a great place in the challenge .. :)<br/></td>', 'i''ll have to disagree with you and anyone else who wasnt a fan of the sunflare  .. or the intensity of it .. ;)i love it .. as well as the excellent edit you have given this .. so grungy .. and appropriate .. congratulations on a great place in the challenge .. :)', '2021-01-11 00:53:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684080, 1257793, 67145, '<td valign="top">i dont know why exactly but this one makes me smile .. <br/>sorry old abandoned building .. !! .. <br/>its just the growth .. like i said in voting .. feels like an old guy with a beard and lots of hair .. very unkempt .. <br/>congratulations on a great place in the challenge and a wonderful edit .. loved that particularly . to the point where i wanted to ask you what you did .. :)x</td>', 'i dont know why exactly but this one makes me smile .. sorry old abandoned building .. !! .. its just the growth .. like i said in voting .. feels like an old guy with a beard and lots of hair .. very unkempt .. congratulations on a great place in the challenge and a wonderful edit .. loved that particularly . to the point where i wanted to ask you what you did .. :)x', '2021-01-11 00:55:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684081, 1257815, 67145, '<td valign="top">i really like the hdr effect . if that''s what it is .. <br/>whatever you''ve done its perfect for this photo .. <br/>i think i said it all during voting .. <br/>but not this .. congratulations on a great place in the challenge .. :)<br/></td>', 'i really like the hdr effect . if that''s what it is .. whatever you''ve done its perfect for this photo .. i think i said it all during voting .. but not this .. congratulations on a great place in the challenge .. :)', '2021-01-11 00:58:22.000000', NULL, 0),
