(7684129, 1257758, 114285, '<td valign="top">Perfectly composed! <br/> <br/>Love the shadows that the tree cast on the roof. The editing is spot on grungy also.</td>', 'Perfectly composed!  Love the shadows that the tree cast on the roof. The editing is spot on grungy also.', '2021-01-11 07:54:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684130, 1257801, 114285, '<td valign="top">So beautiful and whimsical, should of scored higher, imho.</td>', 'So beautiful and whimsical, should of scored higher, imho.', '2021-01-11 07:56:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684142, 1257815, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the outtakes for getting the rest of the story.  The wider view is interesting for getting scale of the project / building.  The interior view is fun as well and has lots of interesting items to take in.  <br/> <br/>Honestly, in the end I still would have scored your entry higher than the outtakes (gave you a 7).  Not sure if you''re asking for that info or just sharing other perspectives, but, hey, now you have it.  :-)</td>', 'I like the outtakes for getting the rest of the story.  The wider view is interesting for getting scale of the project / building.  The interior view is fun as well and has lots of interesting items to take in.   Honestly, in the end I still would have scored your entry higher than the outtakes (gave you a 7).  Not sure if you''re asking for that info or just sharing other perspectives, but, hey, now you have it.  :-)', '2021-01-11 11:32:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7684151, 1257761, 122678, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!<br/>Wow, this certainly does meet the challenge, they even left their things when they abandoned this house.<br/>Very well shot image. A well deserved blue.</td>', 'Congratulations!Wow, this certainly does meet the challenge, they even left their things when they abandoned this house.Very well shot image. A well deserved blue.', '2021-01-11 13:15:56.000000', NULL, 0),
